{"parentUuid":"74581e9e-6e99-41b9-9ef8-20d0b83b88a3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf81sYW7frRa4npHWRGgY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sync is done and checked. I ran the full check again at the end: all 139 repos are clean and match GitHub.\n\n**Sync**\n- **Pulled:** config, skills and memory. Memory got 15 commits from Windows. The newest is `9e36b0d Sleep scheduler line: trim under cap`.\n- **Memory repo:** 2 daily log files had a merge conflict (Mac and Windows both wrote to the same file). I kept the text from both machines and pushed.\n- **Pulled Windows work** into 5 repos: `CFB_Forecast_Archive`, `CFB_Victory_Model`, `PP_Recruiting`, `sleep-scheduler`, `Tech_Inventory_Analysis`.\n- **Saved and pushed Mac changes** in `CommandCentre` (one server log) and `graphify-out` (rebuilt graph files).\n- **Cloned** `Weekly_Research_Review`, which was made on Windows today.\n- **Not committed:** `~/.claude/skills/synced/`. It is the Claude app's own skill cache, and the new skills commit already tells git to ignore it.\n- No conflicts in project repos, and no `.from-windows` copies were made.\n\n**Errors from the startup scripts**\n1. **GPS pull (07:24):** the laptop could not reach Catapult. It could not look up the server's address, so the network was probably down. It runs again tomorrow at 06:30.\n2. **memsearch index (12:46):** it failed while loading `onnxruntime`, a library the memory search needs. This is still broken. I did not fix it.\n3. **Daily backup (09:04):** it said `global-memory` and `dotclaude` had split from GitHub. This sync fixed that.\n\n**Picking up: CFB_Victory_Model**\n- **Last session:** today (9/16), Windows.\n- **Where things stand:** all 16 Big 12 teams are captured. The model picked the winner in 28 of 30 games in Weeks 1–2. Baylor is at 5.27 expected wins, up from 4.49. The capture script bug is fixed.\n- **Blocked on:** one choice. Merge or delete the branch `worktree-eval-all-games` (a test run over 6,002 games)?\n- **Next:** the next Big 12 capture is around 9/23. Run `python weekly_capture.py`, then `python compare_snapshots.py --all --archive`.\n\nWhat do you want to work on? That repo, the memsearch error, or something else?\n\nresult: DEV sync finished; all 139 repos are clean and match GitHub, and CFB_Victory_Model is ready to pick up."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1617,"cache_read_input_tokens":89840,"output_tokens":986,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":116},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1617,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":986,"cache_read_input_tokens":89840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1617,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1617},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cf81sXx8S5dM4Cf4EBPnC","attributionSkill":"dev-sync","type":"assistant","uuid":"89b207a3-c44a-4d09-b8a0-7905d78e8f4c","timestamp":"2026-09-16T23:51:09.089Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"35d4f785-606b-402b-829e-4e9c3081934b","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"35d4f785-606b-402b-829e-4e9c3081934b","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"main"}
