{"parentUuid":"a0460214-b92c-4bfc-a9d6-b4820178c94d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"skill_listing","content":"- research-in-5: Build a \"Research in 5\" weekly paper review for Baylor Athletics staff: a 5-slide deck (dark and light), a Teams post, and a staff email from one research paper. Use when the user says \"/research-in-5\", \"research in 5 on this paper\", \"weekly research review\", \"review this paper for the staff\", \"make the slides for this paper\", \"turn this study into a research review\", or hands over a paper (PDF, DOI, article URL, or Zotero item) for the weekly series. Also use to rebuild, restyle, or version an existing review (#001, v2, v3). Do not use for a research-backed answer to a sport-science question (use sports-science-research-grounding), a topic education deck with no single paper (use five-slides-generator), a plain Zotero search (use pp-zotero-research-library), or a quick in-chat summary of a paper when no deck, Teams post, or email is wanted.","skillCount":1,"isInitial":false,"names":["research-in-5"]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"6e348d52-aad8-4347-ae0a-cb330486fbdc","timestamp":"2026-09-17T00:00:50.720Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe following skills are available for use with the Skill tool:\n\n- research-in-5: Build a \"Research in 5\" weekly paper review for Baylor Athletics staff: a 5-slide deck (dark and light), a Teams post, and a staff email from one research paper. Use when the user says \"/research-in-5\", \"research in 5 on this paper\", \"weekly research review\", \"review this paper for the staff\", \"make the slides for this paper\", \"turn this study into a research review\", or hands over a paper (PDF, DOI, article URL, or Zotero item) for the weekly series. Also use to rebuild, restyle, or version an existing review (#001, v2, v3). Do not use for a research-backed answer to a sport-science question (use sports-science-research-grounding), a topic education deck with no single paper (use five-slides-generator), a plain Zotero search (use pp-zotero-research-library), or a quick in-chat summary of a paper when no deck, Teams post, or email is wanted.\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"35d4f785-606b-402b-829e-4e9c3081934b","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"35d4f785-606b-402b-829e-4e9c3081934b","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"main"}
