{"parentUuid":"b3ec1e7d-3508-402f-b347-37fccb45fe97","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf82hVFFafi7yJFuQ93Wx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You asked me to fix the memsearch error. I found the cause and tested it. **memsearch was never broken.**\n\n**What happened**\n- At 07:46 the Mac restarted. That ended a Claude session.\n- When a session ends, a hook starts memsearch indexing in the background. It was still loading `onnxruntime` when macOS began to shut down.\n- macOS does not load program files while it shuts down. So the load failed, and the hook wrote that failure to the error log.\n\n**Checks**\n- The Mac restart time was 07:46:56. The error was at 07:46.\n- The memsearch install has not changed since Aug 5.\n- The failure came before memsearch opened its database. So nothing was half-written, and no lock file was left behind.\n- A real test run on `~/.claude/global-memory/transcripts` worked: `Indexed 94 chunks`, exit 0.\n- I only tested that one folder. The other folders update when this session ends and in the nightly full re-index.\n\n**Your decision: stop this false alarm from coming back?**\n- **A (my pick):** I add \"system is shutting down\" to the hook's list of short-term errors. Then a restart during indexing no longer writes a hard error. It is a one-line change in `~/.claude/hooks/memsearch-sync.js`. Codex uses the same file through a link, so both are covered.\n- **B:** Change nothing. You may see this same false error again when a restart happens right after a session ends.\n\nI did not clear the error log. Your closeout routine does that after a clean run.\n\nresult: memsearch works (test index ran clean). The error came from a Mac restart at 07:46, not a broken install. Your pick: A (a one-line hook change to stop false alarms) or B (change nothing)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2010,"cache_read_input_tokens":221607,"output_tokens":942,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":355},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1065,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":208,"cache_read_input_tokens":110271,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1065,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1065},"type":"message"},{"input_tokens":109362,"output_tokens":3120,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"advisor_message","model":"claude-fable-5-1"},{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":734,"cache_read_input_tokens":111336,"cache_creation_input_tokens":945,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":945,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":5,"requestId":"req_011Cf82hUeHV4f96JLDcoJm9","attributionSkill":"superpowers:systematic-debugging","attributionPlugin":"superpowers","type":"assistant","uuid":"d5410451-d1f1-4cd1-8ac3-0dc49348c21c","timestamp":"2026-09-17T00:02:51.496Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"35d4f785-606b-402b-829e-4e9c3081934b","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"35d4f785-606b-402b-829e-4e9c3081934b","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"main"}
